emorial Justice Assistance Grant program.</p><p>Additionally, the BJA must develop and publish best practices for the use, deployment, and maintenance of trauma kits by law enforcement agencies.</p>","updateDate":"2026-04-20T19:40:49Z","versionCode":"55"}],"title":"Improving Police CARE Act","type":"s","updateDate":"2026-09-24T22:04:24Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-24T22:04:24Z"}
